 last as long as you can against endless waves of terrorists, helicopters, zombies, and other creatures. Submit your score in the worldwide leaderboards.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiple game modes and maps<br></li><li>Massive selection of weapons, attachments, and equipment<br></li><li>Fully customizable characters<br></li><li>Ranked matches and multiplayer clans<br></li><li>Custom classes and killstreaks<br></li><li>Intense fast-paced gameplay</li></ul>","developers":["Wilkin Games"],"dlc":[1641204,1641205,1641200,1641201,1641202],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1131080/header.jpg?t=1762391106","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a92024 Wilkin Games. Deadswitch 3 is developed by Wilkin Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 64-bit Linux OS<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1131080/362628/f25df269f5fbf5f7edada7821c389d72b38777f9/1751192808/dash_av1.mpd?t=1618683049","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1131080/362628/f25df269f5fbf5f7edada7821c389d72b38777f9/1751192808/dash_h264.mpd?t=1618683049","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1131080/362628/f25df269f5fbf5f7edada7821c389d72b38777f9/1751192808/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1618683049","id":256830950,"name":"Deadswitch 3 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/256830950/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1618683049"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1131080/366057/96dbc325ede703402ba